WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:04.720
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The Foundation: When writing a report,

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.660
more detail is expected than "Object class:
Keter.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.900
Special Containment Procedures: [DATA EXPUNGED].

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.250
Description: [DATA EXPUNGED]."

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:17.430
And inventing new security clearances just
so nobody can see what you've written is also

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.240
considered poor form.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:24.070
We all know sometimes RAISA can get a little
redaction-happy, we understand the frustration,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.670
but that’s frankly no excuse to fill your
documents with nonsense and then hide them

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.670
from us.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:33.690
If you keep doing this, we’ll send Technical
Researcher Rosen after you, and we both know

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.870
that guy’s a huge jerk.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:40.809
Mark our words, Dr. Bright, we are not bluffing
- even if you do claim to have Security Clearance

00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:43.409
Level 420!

